#: ../../reference/formats.rst:4 6d27c8d3d96b44baab7efb5289b8f9ba
msgid "Race formats"
msgstr "Formati di gara"

#: ../../reference/formats.rst:6 b1e2fb513a514b69ba8280a98906a4ab
msgid ""
"A format takes the start list plus whatever the jury typed and returns an "
"ordered list of ``Placing``. Sorting is the same everywhere: classified "
"entrants by their own result, then ``REL``, ``DNF``, ``DNS``, ``NS``, "
"``DSQ`` — one convention (``core/formats/base.py``), not a sentinel scheme "
"per format."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/formats.rst:11 5d252045d93d4964a1922ad9bcd773b5
msgid ""
"Everything a format needs lives in the persisted ``RaceState.payload``, so a"
" browser reload or a crash loses nothing. ``core.race`` is the service layer"
" above them: who is entered, which format applies, how a bracket composes "
"the round after it."
msgstr ""

